#: kcmaccess.cpp:343
msgid "Use gestures for activating the above features"
msgstr ""

#: kcmaccess.cpp:347
msgid ""
"Here you can activate keyboard gestures that turn on the following features: "
"\n"
"Sticky keys: Press Shift key 5 consecutive times\n"
"Slow keys: Hold down Shift for 8 seconds"
msgstr ""

#: kcmaccess.cpp:351
msgid ""
"Here you can activate keyboard gestures that turn on the following features: "
"\n"
"Mouse Keys: %1\n"
"Sticky keys: Press Shift key 5 consecutive times\n"
"Slow keys: Hold down Shift for 8 seconds"
msgstr ""

#: kcmaccess.cpp:358
msgid "Show a confirmation dialog whenever a gesture is used"
msgstr ""

#: kcmaccess.cpp:360
msgid ""
"KDE will show a confirmation dialog whenever a gesture is used if this "
"option is checked.\n"
"Be carefull do know what yo do if you uncheck it as then the AccessX "
"settings will always be applied without confirmation."
msgstr ""

